<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>AI工具与模型HOT</title><link>https://staroltest.github.io/ai-tool-model-hot/</link><description>每天从 16 个信源收 AI 模型发布与主流智能体更新，按规则打分精选，只显示标题、一句简介与原文链接，不转载全文。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 21:43:01 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>Gemini 应用现已支持低内存安卓设备</title><link>https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/products/gemini-app/gemini-lower-memory-devices</link><description>Gemini 应用放宽了安卓设备的内存门槛，低内存手机也能用上 Gemini Live 和自定义图片生成功能。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">8e6075d168e06821304f71b020ff8006369d63dc</guid><source url="https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/products/gemini-app/gemini-lower-memory-devices">Google AI Blog</source></item><item><title>OpenAI Agents SDK v0.24.0</title><link>https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-python/releases/tag/v0.24.0</link><description>Agents SDK 发布 0.24.0 版，统一运行级函数错误格式并新增 MCP 发现标注，同时改进故障恢复、沙箱安全与链路追踪。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:20:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f6af3e2f5c3e509526f2682898852981da3684a7</guid><source url="https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-python/releases/tag/v0.24.0">OpenAI Agents SDK Releases</source></item><item><title>Gemini 4 Neon 发布：前沿能力与执行速度兼顾的新成员</title><link>https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-4-neon</link><description>Gemini 4 家族的新成员，主打复杂编程、知识工作与科学任务的快速端到端完成，定位在 Carbon 与 Hydrogen 之间，兼顾前沿能力与成本效率，已在 Gemini API 与 AI Studio 上线。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 21:35:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">b898a1b2127c5756e1c018cc6a81581a6294cda6</guid><source url="https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-4-neon">Google DeepMind Blog</source></item><item><title>Claude Code 2.1.327 发布</title><link>https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-327</link><description>Claude Code 2.1.327 在安装 GitHub 应用改动仓库前先征求确认，并让 MCP 服务器配置可从标准输入读取 JSON。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:22:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">2b7a7366c72677641c0dd7f4007e9797114b8bbe</guid><source url="https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-327">Claude Code Changelog</source></item><item><title>Qwen Code v0.27.4 每日构建版（11 月 16 日）</title><link>https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.27.4-nightly.20261116.eb3a599ef3</link><description>Qwen Code 的每日构建版，包含网页端工作区筛选和托管智能体的钉钉适配等最新改动。</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 23:24:42 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">33a4d7ce33a6d15e274f5667bf1453f327e4a275</guid><source url="https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.27.4-nightly.20261116.eb3a599ef3">Qwen Code Releases</source></item><item><title>LangSmith 面向编码智能体：按成果追踪花费</title><link>https://www.langchain.com/blog/langsmith-coding-agents-roi</link><description>LangSmith 为编码智能体新增报表能力，把智能体的花费与它产出的拉取请求挂钩，方便团队按实际成果衡量投入。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:00:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">6985c741cc7eaaabeaaf9f18e65ae45fa5f5acf9</guid><source url="https://www.langchain.com/blog/langsmith-coding-agents-roi">LangChain Blog</source></item><item><title>180B 参数、32GB 内存：用 Transformers 把 MoE 推理推向极限</title><link>https://huggingface.co/blog/moe-expert-streaming</link><description>仅用 32GB 内存就能跑起 180B 参数的 MoE 模型，Transformers 借助专家流式加载，让大模型推理对普通硬件更友好。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">af1852b4c46dc30e685f171de7728ab1aafefce8</guid><source url="https://huggingface.co/blog/moe-expert-streaming">Hugging Face Blog</source></item><item><title>OpenAI 模型助力芯片设计取得进展</title><link>https://openai.com/index/advancing-chip-design-with-our-models</link><description>OpenAI 的模型参与优化了 Jalapeño 芯片电路与 RISC-V 核心设计，展现了 AI 辅助芯片设计的实际进展。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">c7d3ecb006439a135768f56529a5adc2ad0eb57f</guid><source url="https://openai.com/index/advancing-chip-design-with-our-models">OpenAI News</source></item><item><title>Genie 4 现已上线</title><link>https://deepmind.google/blog/genie-4-is-now-available</link><description>DeepMind 的交互式世界模型 Genie 4 正式开放，可由文字或图像提示生成能够实时探索的互动世界。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 18:13:42 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">50e3ea47cbae988d3477f301b521889b55c9580b</guid><source url="https://deepmind.google/blog/genie-4-is-now-available">Google DeepMind Blog</source></item><item><title>为什么你的微调任务比 FLOPs 测算的更耗时</title><link>https://huggingface.co/blog/Dharma-AI/predicting-fine-tuning-time</link><description>一篇来自 Hugging Face 的实测分析，解释微调耗时为何常超出算力估算，并给出更靠谱的时间预测思路。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 18:53:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">75623b38e68bd27d92e36a52d6a4cbbd66f1e8a3</guid><source url="https://huggingface.co/blog/Dharma-AI/predicting-fine-tuning-time">Hugging Face Blog</source></item><item><title>为你的团队定制 GitHub Copilot</title><link>https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-18-customize-github-copilot-for-your-team</link><description>团队定制功能正式面向组织团队开放，成员无需各自重复配置，即可共享团队常用的 Copilot 插件。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 16:00:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f9b17ed5db16e28ce5120e656f075832e401a446</guid><source url="https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-18-customize-github-copilot-for-your-team">GitHub Copilot Changelog</source></item><item><title>DaisyRose-27B：推进后训练效率的前沿</title><link>https://huggingface.co/blog/RadixArk/daisyrose-27b-pushing-the-frontier-of-post-trainin</link><description>RadixArk 发布 27B 参数模型 DaisyRose，探索用更少的后训练投入换取更强的模型表现。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:54:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f689168723dc030df68e3b673ab44c5f35046795</guid><source url="https://huggingface.co/blog/RadixArk/daisyrose-27b-pushing-the-frontier-of-post-trainin">Hugging Face Blog</source></item><item><title>OpenAI 发布 GPT-6.2 Astra 与 Sol</title><link>https://openai.com/index/introducing-gpt-6-2-astra-sol</link><description>GPT-6.2 Astra 与 Sol 在专业输出、编程、电脑操作与成本效率上都有提升，已覆盖 ChatGPT Work、Codex 与 API。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 17:45:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">549a77347d5e1e5f25e081258d641a2b8758c868</guid><source url="https://openai.com/index/introducing-gpt-6-2-astra-sol">OpenAI News</source></item><item><title>GPT-6.2 Astra 与 Sol 接入 GitHub Copilot</title><link>https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-openais-gpt-6-2-astra-and-gpt-6-2-sol-now-available</link><description>OpenAI 的 GPT-6.2 Astra 与 Sol 已在 GitHub Copilot 全面可用，面向智能体编程与代码评审做了强化。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 20:20:29 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">96ff71f54c6e7b4da47668acaa4a513b0085cd1a</guid><source url="https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-openais-gpt-6-2-astra-and-gpt-6-2-sol-now-available">GitHub Copilot Changelog</source></item><item><title>如何为 AI 智能体选择合适的沙箱</title><link>https://www.langchain.com/blog/how-to-choose-the-right-sandbox-for-your-agent</link><description>LangChain 讲清楚怎么给智能体挑沙箱，从文件隔离、网络访问、资源限制到微虚拟机，帮你在安全和好用之间找到平衡。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 00:46:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">47f85eb4378da619d39f756b24da83b48251cbbf</guid><source url="https://www.langchain.com/blog/how-to-choose-the-right-sandbox-for-your-agent">LangChain Blog</source></item><item><title>Qwen Code v0.28.1 预览版</title><link>https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.28.1-preview.0</link><description>Qwen Code 的预览更新，验证了托管智能体的定时任务触发，并加固了状态检查与容器配置。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 19:56:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">564aa296ded401b85b17beac2a3926158ef632e6</guid><source url="https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.28.1-preview.0">Qwen Code Releases</source></item><item><title>Qwen Code v0.28.0</title><link>https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.28.0</link><description>Qwen Code 发布 0.28.0，网页端加了工作区筛选，托管智能体新增钉钉适配，没有已知破坏性改动。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 11:20:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">4dbe53199800181e733570ebf4916f9070758469</guid><source url="https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.28.0">Qwen Code Releases</source></item><item><title>Qwen Code 桌面版 v0.28.0</title><link>https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/desktop-v0.28.0</link><description>Qwen Code 桌面版同步到 0.28.0，网页端支持工作区筛选，托管智能体新增钉钉适配。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 12:31:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">788442c73cbb02e0640f1da56367227ad53ee20b</guid><source url="https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/desktop-v0.28.0">Qwen Code Releases</source></item><item><title>OpenAI Agents SDK v0.25.0</title><link>https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-python/releases/tag/v0.25.0</link><description>Agents SDK 发布 0.25.0，开放了第三方会话适配器的工具方法，移除了 Runloop 沙箱提供方，并加入了可开关的交接错误恢复。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 00:38:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">c4677f385445c7757e4900f265f1ce7a26aef411</guid><source url="https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-python/releases/tag/v0.25.0">OpenAI Agents SDK Releases</source></item><item><title>OpenAI 与法国费加罗集团合作，将《费加罗报》新闻带入 ChatGPT</title><link>https://openai.com/index/le-groupe-figaro-and-openai-announce-partnership</link><description>OpenAI 与法国费加罗集团达成合作，ChatGPT 将引用《费加罗报》的报道内容并附上原文链接。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">6cab9c8cd38347e314ec19080853721e61b4aabd</guid><source url="https://openai.com/index/le-groupe-figaro-and-openai-announce-partnership">OpenAI News</source></item></channel></rss>
